# Firebase client config. Not strictly secret — it ships inside the app bundle,
# and the credential that can actually send pushes is the service account in SSM,
# not this. Kept out anyway because the repo is public: it names the Firebase
# project, and an API key sitting in a public repo attracts scanners and gets
# riskier the moment that project gains anything beyond FCM. Fetch it from the
# Firebase console instead; see README.
app/android/app/google-services.json
app/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

